  "name": "Marinated Salmon",
  "subtitle": "Citrus-herb salmon with a sweet, tangy marinade",
  "description": "Salmon fillets are seasoned, marinated with lemon, garlic, herbs, and vinegar, then roasted at high heat until opaque and flaky.",
